-25T14:33:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9348379373550415,"text_excerpt":"Had a tasty California omelet and eggs Benedict, very good and great value too, Prices are very reasonable. The folks who run this place are wonderful too. I also recommend the lunch salads. It has a nice atmosphere. They deliver too :)."},{"business_id":"yGyU_iKbbbjz7rLn0uD7Vg","review_id":"77QizYrl0ov7DaFeXXH8sw","date":"2011-12-13T01:20:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9172956943511963,"text_excerpt":"This is a great breakfast place! My friend and I went here after finding the long line across the street. I needed to eat and run, so I didn't have time to wait for a table. I was always wary of this place because it was part of the frat-tastic side of uptown, and getting door hangers from them, I wasn't too impressed. I am so glad that I came in! The food was soo good. I got an omlet that pretty good, but my friend ordered the fruit and nutella crepe. Amazing. It was so amazing, i ordered one to go for another friend, and she proclaimed that it was AMAZING too. I also love that the waitress asked if we wanted our coffee to go. Some people have told me it's pretty common, but this is a fi..."},{"business_id":"yGyU_iKbbbjz7rLn0uD7Vg","review_id":"WW8ybCb0OdNMr2pM5_EAbg","date":"2014-10-20T15:41:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9139092564582825,"text_excerpt":"This was a great spot to stop and have breakfast on a Monday morning. The staff is very nice and our meals tasted great. There is a noticeable difference when a restaurant uses fresh ingredients. I had an omelette that could have used a bit more sausage, but it was tasty. My wife had bananas foster French toast that I really enjoyed finishing it for her. They offer fresh fruit smoothies and make a good Bloody Mary."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
